## Visual Studio / .NET ignore rules

# Build results
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio files
.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.suo

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.userprefs

# Windows thumbnail cache
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# Folder config file
Desktop.ini

# Recycle Bin used on shared network drives
$RECYCLE.BIN/
